  <item><p>
<type-name>reference</type-name> </p>
<truncated level="single-line"><p>
References, <inline-code>&T</inline-code> and <inline-code>&mut T</inline-code>.</p>
A reference represents a borrow of some owned value.<inline-code>&</inline-code> or <inline-code>&mut</inline-code> operators on a value, or by using a <inline-code>ref</inline-code> or ref mut pattern. <elided chars="4803"/></truncated>
</item>
  <item><p>
<type-name>slice</type-name> </p>
